  "description": "After days of starvation, my vision blurred, and a shadow spoke to me.\n\nThat night, I made a pact with the shadow. By eating the sins of others, I gained a life where I would never have to starve again. Since gaining my powers, I've lost the ability to taste ordinary food, and I've accumulated a bit (a lot?) of a criminal record… But you know what? Sin tastes better.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
